:"reference","qid":"Q3792","articleTitle":"洛美","sourceRevision":94532879,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 洛美","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B4%9B%E7%BE%8E"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94532879"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3792"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159149313","name":"阿塔帕梅","country":"TGO","lat":7.53004,"lon":1.12002,"kind":"city","region":"TG-P","rank":4,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"阿塔帕梅 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"阿塔帕梅（法语：）是位于多哥高原区中部的一座城市，距离首都洛美约160公里。","culture":"该国主要铁路干线洛美—布利塔铁路曾有一条支线连接该市，但已经停止运行。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q126124","articleTitle":"阿塔帕梅","sourceRevision":94758832,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 阿塔帕梅","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%98%BF%E5%A1%94%E5%B8%95%E6%A2%85"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94758832"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q126124"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159133817","name":"帕利梅","country":"TGO","lat":6.90039,"lon":0.63003,"kind":"city","region":"TG-P","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"帕利梅 · 地点概要","geo":"帕利梅是位于多哥西南部、邻近加纳边境的一座城市，周边拥有大量的可可种植园。\n帕利梅著名的景点包括建于1913年天主教教堂和多哥海拔最高的Mount Agou。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q995413","articleTitle":"帕利梅","sourceRevision":90431200,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 帕利梅","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B8%95%E5%88%A9%E6%A2%85"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90431200"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q995413"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159133821","name":"索科德","country":"TGO","lat":8.99047,"lon":1.15,"kind":"city","region":"TG-C","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159133827","name":"曼戈","country":"TGO","lat":10.35956,"lon":0.47081,"kind":"city","region":"TG-S","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159112719","name":"巴萨","country":"TGO","lat":9.261,"lon":0.789,"kind":"city","region":"TG-K","rank":10,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"巴萨 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"巴萨（，卡比耶语：Paasɛɛ）是位于西非国家多哥卡拉区西部的一座城市。","culture":null,"see":"在历史上，巴萨是当地冶铁业的中心，境内有15处村庄的冶铁遗址，包括高炉、炉底、矿渣堆、矿井，以及锻造的痕迹，它们记录了公元前5世纪到20世纪中叶期间，当地多个年代炼铁与铁器加工技术的演变。\n该遗址现今也被多哥政府列入世界遗产的预备名单。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q810474","articleTitle":"巴萨","sourceRevision":91605201,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 巴萨","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B7%B4%E8%90%A8"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91605201"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q810474"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159112735","name":"索圖布阿","country":"TGO","lat":8.557,"lon":0.985,"kind":"city","region":"TG-C","rank":10,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"索圖布阿 · 地点概要","geo":"1965年6月12日，两辆货车撞向一群舞蹈员，造成125人死亡，这是有记录以来最严重的交通事故之一。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q1120978","articleTitle":"索圖布阿","sourceRevision":90431849,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","att